OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple 'code blues' at prison
OL,4,Aamid laced drug fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been nearly 30 "code blues"
OL,7,Fat a prison where a contaminated batch
OL,8,Fof illegal drugs is feared to have
OL,9,Fcaused two deaths.
OL,11,FPrison staff trigger a code blue in a
OL,12,Fsevere medical situation such as a
OL,13,Fdrugs overdose, where symptoms could
OL,14,Finclude breathing difficulties or
OL,15,Funconsciousness.
OL,17,FMultiple ambulances have been called to
OL,18,FHMP Ranby - a Category C prison in
OL,19,FNottinghamshire - between Tuesday and
OL,20,FThursday. At least 25 inmates are
OL,21,Fbelieved to have been "under the
OL,22,Finfluence".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
